Method 
The following section presents an overview of the process of acquiring HUD data and the method for estimating the distortion of display elements and explains how our approach overcomes the limitations of existing methods. 
Experimental results 
We will present our experimental results in this section. First, we compare the accuracy of the prediction with Li’s method, and then we examine the utility of the solution we propose in this paper. Finally, we explore a generalization of neural networks and collect a small amount of data to achieve higher accuracy. 
Conclusion 
AR-HUD demand is rapidly increasing, and this technology will soon become an essential part of the automotive industry. Current HUDs, however, are far from perfect. 
